#  log10(T) = ]3.700,4.500] in steps of  0.050
#
#  log10(R) range: nre= 19  values from -8.000  to  1.000
#                           in steps of  0.500
#
#
#  Composition parameters:
#
#       X     = hydrogen mass fraction
#               mh =  1 values from 0.900 to 0.900 in steps of 0.100
#       Zref  = 3.800000E-02  reference metallicity
